    ///
    ///  * ` ` - Line context
    ///  * `+` - Line addition
    ///  * `-` - Line deletion
    ///  * `=` - Context (End of file)
    ///  * `>` - Add (End of file)
    ///  * `<` - Remove (End of file)
    ///  * `F` - File header
    ///  * `H` - Hunk header
    ///  * `B` - Line binary
